{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)resetUserId","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resetUserId"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"resetUserId","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"resetUserId","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"symbolKind":"method"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"resetUserId","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this on logout or account deletion. The user ID becomes the HWID again, as on a fresh install,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the SDK sends "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/registerUser"},{"text":" with the HWID so the server stops attributing the device to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"previous user. ","type":"text"},{"code":"setUserId(\"\")","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" does not reset the user: an empty value is ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The call waits until the SDK is ready, like ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"setUserId:"},{"text":". If the HWID was already registered","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"as the user less than a day ago, no request is sent.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading"},{"code":["func handleLogout() {","    Pushwoosh.configure.resetUserId()","    Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([\"logged_in\": false])","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"code":["[[Pushwoosh configure] resetUserId];"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"objc"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/resetuserid"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Resets the user identifier to the HWID."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/resetUserId","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/resetUserId":{"kind":"symbol","title":"resetUserId","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"resetUserId","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/resetUserId","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/resetuserid","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"resetUserId","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Resets the user identifier to the HWID.","type":"text"}]},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"abstract":[{"text":"Protocol defining SDK configuration methods.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"PWConfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","kind":"symbol","title":"PushwooshCore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"role":"collection","type":"topic"}}}